WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.449
Si vives en California

00:00:01.474 --> 00:00:02.398
y buscas vista al

00:00:02.423 --> 00:00:02.803
mar,

00:00:02.954 --> 00:00:04.700
conoce Punta Pacífico, en

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:05.483
Ensenada.

00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:07.535
Dos o tres recámaras

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.458
y roof garden para

00:00:08.483 --> 00:00:09.874
volver con tu familia.

00:00:10.647 --> 00:00:11.710
Imagina tardes de

00:00:11.735 --> 00:00:12.303
alberca,

00:00:12.481 --> 00:00:13.658
asadores en familia

00:00:13.683 --> 00:00:14.595
y reuniones en el

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.050
salón de usos múltiples

00:00:16.075 --> 00:00:16.984
al aire libre:

00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:18.276
primeras amenidades

00:00:18.301 --> 00:00:19.249
proyectadas.

00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:21.123
Cuida tu liquidez con

00:00:21.148 --> 00:00:22.273
pagos flexibles:

00:00:22.451 --> 00:00:23.312
diez por ciento de

00:00:23.337 --> 00:00:23.930
enganche,

00:00:24.159 --> 00:00:25.007
diez por ciento en

00:00:25.032 --> 00:00:26.373
diecinueve mensualidades

00:00:26.398 --> 00:00:27.474
y ochenta por ciento

00:00:27.499 --> 00:00:28.434
contra entrega.

00:00:29.207 --> 00:00:30.447
Plusvalía estimada del

00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:31.673
ocho por ciento anual,

00:00:31.839 --> 00:00:32.661
en un escenario

00:00:32.686 --> 00:00:33.583
conservador.

00:00:34.356 --> 00:00:35.344
Y que cada visita

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:36.432
sea tiempo para los

00:00:36.457 --> 00:00:37.075
tuyos.

00:00:37.848 --> 00:00:38.595
Haz clic en el

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:39.607
botón de abajo para

00:00:39.632 --> 00:00:40.732
más información.
